# Turn Inside Out gives Llanowar Elves +3/+0 (a 4/1), and "when it dies this turn" is a delayed triggered ability
# (CR 603.7c) that waits for that creature. Lightning Bolt then kills the Elves: the ability triggers (CR 700.4,
# looking back, CR 603.10a) and its controller manifests dread (CR 701.62a): of Guerrilla Gorilla and Island the Gorilla
# goes onto the battlefield face down as a nameless 2/2 and the Island into the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Llanowar Elves
Turn Inside Out
Lightning Bolt
Island x2
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

